ucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Sign in to sync"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/06"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Items to avoid"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Don’t take multivitamins for longevity or heart protection"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Don’t take regular fish oil capsules to prevent heart disease"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Don’t give vitamin D supplements to people who already have enough"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Don’t take antioxidant supplements to prevent cancer (beta-carotene, vitamin E, vitamin A)"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Don’t expect glucosamine/chondroitin to treat knee osteoarthritis"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Don’t rely on vitamin C to prevent colds"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Don’t get a whole-body PET-CT or tumor marker panel if you have no symptoms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Don’t expect fitness trackers or smartwatches to help you lose weight"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Don’t pay a premium for organic food just to be “healthier”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Don’t spend a lot of money on health supplements, herbal formulas, or tonics to “improve your health”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Don’t take probiotics long-term if you have no gut problems"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Don’t force yourself to take cold showers just to “boost immunity”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Don’t buy products marketed for detox, colon cleansing, enzymes, or alkaline water"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Don’t force yourself to drink water just to hit “8 glasses a day”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Don’t spend money on fortune‑telling, tarot, or astrology to make decisions"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Don’t buy blue-light-blocking glasses to “protect your vision,” and don’t believe claims that staring at screens for months will ruin your eyes — but severe eye pain, redness, and swelling require immediate medical attention"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Don’t treat blood donation as a health habit: claims that it “detoxifies, lowers cholesterol, and prevents heart attacks” lack randomized trial support, while frequent donation truly causes iron deficiency"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Don’t rely on generic health check packages to prevent disease; instead, get the evidence‑based screenings appropriate for your age and gender"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Don’t start taking uric‑acid‑lowering drugs just because a checkup shows high uric acid but you’ve never had symptoms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"Don’t have a gallbladder removed prophylactically just because an ultrasound found gallstones but you’ve never felt any pain"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Don’t cut calcium out to prevent kidney stones"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Don’t buy crystals, bracelets, or Pixiu figurines for “good luck,” “wealth attraction,” or “health benefits”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Don’t expect shopping to lift your mood or boost your sense of self-worth"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Don’t spend extra money to “move up a rung” among your peers by buying a new house, car, or social circle"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"Don’t believe that “willpower is like a muscle that runs out after use”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"Don’t expect skipping breakfast or the 16:8 intermittent fasting method to help you control your weight; instead, pick a meal timing you can stick to long-term"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/06-27","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"Do not believe that \"masturbation harms the body\" or that \"abstinence is the only way to improve\"; what truly matters is whether it interferes with your sleep, work, and relationships"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"Do not spend money on \"conversion therapy\" or \"gay علاج,\" and do not send your family members to undergo it either"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"Do not expect “correct lifting posture” or lifting training to prevent back pain; reduce the weight and number of lifts, and exercise regularly"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"Do not expect extra calcium or bone broth to make a fracture heal faster"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"Don’t rely on an AI chatbot alone to judge a medical or legal problem; before seeing a doctor, going to court or spending big money, find the source it cites and check it against the original"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/06"},"children":["Chapter 6"," ·"," ","Items to avoid"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"06-27"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["27"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["Evidence"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Do not believe that \"masturbation harms the body\" or that \"abstinence is the only way to improve\"; what truly matters is whether it interferes with your sleep, work, and relationships"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["No research says masturbation damages health. Men who ejaculate more often have about 20% fewer prostate cancers, but some research finds higher risk with frequent ejaculation at younger ages. A few people feel weak and flu-like after every ejaculation and take days to recover; this is a rare disorder that a urology or andrology clinic can assess. Feeling ‘addicted to pornography’ is more often related to conflict with one's moral beliefs."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost. What you save is the money spent on \"kidney-tonif…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["First, physical health. A US study followed 31925 men through 2010. They reported their monthly ejaculation fr…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Do not believe that \"masturbation harms the body\" or that \"abstinence is the only way to improve\"; what truly matters is whether it interferes with your sleep, work, and relationships"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost. What you save is the money spent on \"kidney-tonifying\" folk remedies and \"abstinence\" courses, as well as the long-term anxiety caused by self-reproach."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["First, physical health. A US study followed 31925 men through 2010. They reported their monthly ejaculation frequency and were grouped accordingly. Compared with 4 to 7 times a month, more than 21 times a month was associated with a prostate cancer HR of 0.81 (95% CI 0.72–0.92, about 19% lower), using frequency at ages 20 to 29. Using frequency at ages 40 to 49, HR was 0.78 (0.69–0.89, about 22% lower). The reduction mainly involved low-risk prostate cancer. Counter-evidence comes from a UK case-control study comparing 431 patients diagnosed before age 60 with 409 controls. Frequent masturbation in the twenties and thirties was associated with higher risk; in the fifties, with lower risk. On pornography, a systematic review and meta-analysis suggests that many people who feel ‘addicted’ experience a mismatch between their behavior and beliefs, rather than simply watching a lot. Some people genuinely feel ill after every ejaculation, but this is a rare disorder called post-orgasmic illness syndrome (POIS), rather than general ‘damage to the body’. It calls for medical care, rather than abstinence as a cure. Among 45 Dutch patients, 87% developed symptoms within 30 minutes, 80% felt fatigued and weak, and 78% had flu-like symptoms. At a French hospital, 37 patients took an average of 4.7 days to recover. The cause remains unclear. In the Dutch study, 29 of the 33 people skin-tested (88%) reacted to their own semen. A Chinese study of 24 patients found no semen-specific allergy antibodies, while patients had elevated anxiety and depression scores. A 2025 review found only 14 treatment studies, 12 of them case reports. Among 211 sexual-medicine specialists worldwide, only 18% said more than 30% of their patients improved (US / UK / Netherlands / France / China)."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Rider JR, Wilson KM, Sinnott JA, et al. (2016). Ejaculation Frequency and Risk of Prostate Cancer: Updated Results with an Additional Decade of Follow-up. European Urology, 70(6), 974–982. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eururo.2016.03.027","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eururo.2016.03.027"]},"；Dimitropoulou P, Lophatananon A, Easton D, et al. (2009). Sexual activity and prostate cancer risk in men diagnosed at a younger age. BJU International, 103(2), 178–185. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1464-410x.2008.08030.x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1464-410x.2008.08030.x"]},"；Grubbs JB, Perry SL, Wilt JA, Reid RC. (2019). Pornography Problems Due to Moral Incongruence: An Integrative Model with a Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis. Archives of Sexual Behavior, 48(2), 397–415. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10508-018-1248-x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s10508-018-1248-x"]},"；Waldinger MD, Meinardi MM, Zwinderman AH, Schweitzer DH. (2011). Postorgasmic Illness Syndrome (POIS) in 45 Dutch caucasian males: clinical characteristics and evidence for an immunogenic pathogenesis (Part 1). The Journal of Sexual Medicine, 8(4), 1164–1170. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1743-6109.2010.02166.x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1743-6109.2010.02166.x"]},"；Chea M, Teng M, Chesnel C, et al. (2023). Postorgasmic illness syndrome: one or several entities? A retrospective cohort study. The Journal of Sexual Medicine, 20(12), 1407–1413. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jsxmed/qdad139","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/jsxmed/qdad139"]},"；Xi GP, Yang RX, Zhang J, et al. (2023). Clinical characteristics, allergic response to autologous semen, and desensitization in patients with postorgasmic illness syndrome. Sexual Medicine, 11(6), qfad068. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/sexmed/qfad068","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/sexmed/qfad068"]},"；Ponce S, Chapalamadugu M, Levine S, et al. (2025). Treatments for postorgasmic illness syndrome: a systematic review. The Journal of Sexual Medicine, 22(7), 1236–1243. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jsxmed/qdaf112","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/jsxmed/qdaf112"]},"；Duran MB, Rubin RS, Reisman Y, Serefoglu EC, et al. (2025). Recognition and practice patterns of sexual medicine experts towards postorgasmic illness syndrome. International Journal of Impotence Research, 37(6), 454–457. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41443-023-00753-x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1038/s41443-023-00753-x"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eururo.2016.03.027","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Contested. Both prostate cancer studies were observational rather than randomized comparisons, and frequency was recalled by participants. The conclusion goes only as far as ‘no evidence of harm was found’; it does not justify encouraging people to do it more. The UK authors also say the finding in the fifties may reflect illness reducing activity first. The pornography paper's abstract gives no effect size, so only the direction is reported. The benefit is rated small because the reduction mainly concerned low-risk prostate cancers, not death. The studies of post-ejaculation illness each involved only dozens of patients. The literature calls it rare, but nobody has measured its prevalence in the general population. If almost every ejaculation leaves you weak and flu-like for days, visit urology or andrology and mention POIS. Signals to seek psychiatric or psychological care are losing sleep, missing work, harming your relationship, and being unable to stop despite wanting to. For late nights, see Section 3, item 9 (do not stay up for games, short videos or pornography). For concerns about erectile problems from pornography, first follow Section 1, item 28 (check cardiovascular health when erectile function changes). For the legal consequences of sharing in groups or selling material, see Section 9, item 4 (viewing pornography yourself is a separate matter). The beneficiary is you."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/06-26"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"child